---
// The before/after lines are the first and second lines of the p10_redact.py
// capture in the post, shortened to the msg field. Red marks what leaks.
const W = 900, H = 260;
---
<figure class="bep10d">
  <div class="bep10d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after RedactFilter. Before: the message holds the user dict with the password hunter2 and a token, both marked in red. After: the password and the token are replaced with REDACTED.">
    <text x="40" y="36" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Before the filter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước khi qua filter</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="68" class="m">login failed for {'{'}'name': 'holmes', 'password': <tspan class="r">'hunter2'</tspan>{'}'} token=<tspan class="r">eyJhbGciOi.demo.signature</tspan></text>
    <line x1="450" y1="92" x2="450" y2="132" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="444,128 450,142 456,128" class="arrow" />
    <text x="470" y="122" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>RedactFilter on the handler</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>RedactFilter gắn trên handler</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="176" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>After the filter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau khi qua filter</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="208" class="m">login failed for {'{'}'name': 'holmes', 'password': <tspan class="b">[REDACTED]</tspan>{'}'} token=<tspan class="b">[REDACTED]</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="244" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>a net, not a fix: the real fix is not logging the user dict at all</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ là tấm lưới, không phải cách sửa: cách sửa thật là đừng log cả dict user</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One line, same call, before and after. The regex only catches shapes it was written for, so the habit stays: log ids, not objects.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một dòng, cùng một lệnh gọi, trước và sau. Regex chỉ bắt được dạng nó được viết cho, nên thói quen vẫn là: log id, đừng log object.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10d .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10d .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10d .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep10d .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep10d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10d .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10d .ln { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10d .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10d .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep10d .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep10d .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
